<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen stock exchange to close on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen stock exchange to close on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shenzhen stock exchange will close on Wednesday for the New Year holiday, an exchange statement said.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, Shenzhen's domestic A share index closed down 14.59 points or 4.09 percent at 341.81 points and the foreign currency B share index fell 9.71 points or 6.25 percent to end at 145.48 points.</p>
</text>
